er=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909090/extras/d503cd22edc939eea31f8549b8881a2a.poster.avif?t=1742553180\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909090/extras/d503cd22edc939eea31f8549b8881a2a.webm?t=1742553180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909090/extras/d503cd22edc939eea31f8549b8881a2a.mp4?t=1742553180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li>You don't have all the time in the world, though. Better have a spot to hide.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909090/extras/e4ee7c8471e68b39ca984a270c21d92b.poster.avif?t=1742553180\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909090/extras/e4ee7c8471e68b39ca984a270c21d92b.webm?t=1742553180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909090/extras/e4ee7c8471e68b39ca984a270c21d92b.mp4?t=1742553180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul>",
